      text: `<p> Crippling and web buckling may be prevented by<br/> 1. increasing the length of bearing plate.<br/> 2. decreasing the length of bearing plate.<br/> 3. increasing the thickness of the web.<br/> 4. decreasing the thickness of the web.<br/>Of these, the correct statements are: </p>`,
